{"id":"703d3975-9f8d-5242-bca5-61f0223bfb8a","title":"Performance","icon":"⚡","cover":"none","parentId":"c68ed360-d4f3-50ae-9c0b-3592b669b21b","favorite":false,"archived":false,"createdAt":"2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","content":{"type":"surface","attrs":{"id":"root","kind":"page","name":"Performance","widthMode":"standard"},"content":[{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-hero","version":"1.0.0","props":{"eyebrow":"Measurements, results and reproduction","title":"Measured performance and capacity limits","lead":"Recorded measurements cover core reads, editor saves, board gestures, storage writes, and capacity limits. These are observations on specific machines, not throughput guarantees.","facts":[{"label":"Measurement platform","value":"macOS ARM64"},{"label":"cover","value":"Read · Save · Whiteboard · Store"},{"label":"Reproduction script","value":"2 Node scripts"},{"label":"Conversation fragment","value":"≤ 1,000,000 bytes"}],"art":"dev"},"integrity":"sha256-6aa1b6a2a0e9657120847e829da416cc95c91acb8b96f04da0960c1b732e5e84"},"id":"node-5f42599a"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-60425b2d"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Let’s look at the conclusion first"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"metrics","data":{"title":"Optimized observations","items":[{"label":"Project list","value":"13–14","unit":"ms","detail":"3,929–3,981 ms before optimization; 10 projects, 20 pages"},{"label":"All component catalog","value":"23–25","unit":"ms","detail":"Before optimization 3,347–3,441 ms"},{"label":"End of input to formal save","value":"1.3","unit":"s","detail":"1,500 paragraph page, real Electron; ~21 s before optimization"},{"label":"Caching starts until window is ready","value":"About 0.92","unit":"s","detail":"Independent development entrance; does not mean that all page content has been loaded"}]},"id":"node-5d425674"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"When the workbench is opened, it first displays the last checked project list, marked \"Updating project list\", and then changes to the current results. The cache is isolated according to the content library path and does not contain the page body; opening and saving the page still reads the official version."},{"type":"text","text":"Title or quantity in cache cannot be used as write criteria","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":". "}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5e425807"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-5b42534e"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Core read"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"scripts/performance-benchmark.mjs ","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"Rebuild a readable copy of the real content library in an isolated directory, measuring actual Core operations without modifying the input library. Each record records the first call and three subsequent calls; the table below shows the observations for repeated calls."}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5c4254e1"}},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"operate"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-7ffd7667"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-311a79d0"}},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before optimization"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5a36b0fc"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-321a7b63"}},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"After optimization"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-d50eb831"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-331a7cf6"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1064746f"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Project list"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-409a1ba4"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-56e13f3b"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"3,929–3,981 ms"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-45c2ddef"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-55e13da8"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"13–14 ms"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1699a98e"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-58e14261"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f6472dc"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Page list of sample projects"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-639f274d"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-27b80ada"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"387–395 ms"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-3dd861e2"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-28b80c6d"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"4–5 ms"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-6d514823"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-25b807b4"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-12647795"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Formal read and external check of max page"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fca4ec0a"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-ace003a5"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"367–369 ms"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-826c4895"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-abe00212"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"226–234 ms"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-86a5f540"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-aae0007f"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-11647602"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All component catalog"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1eff5a1b"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-85bac1bc"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"3,347–3,441 ms"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-fa75c930"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-86bac34f"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"23–25 ms"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-74fe1e85"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-87bac4e2"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-c646e23"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-59425028"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The test content library has 10 projects, 20 pages, and a maximum of about 5,300 content nodes on a single page. Part of the file cache has been warmed up when the replica is rebuilt, so the \"first call\" is not a cold start of the application; these values ​​are also "},{"type":"text","text":"Does not represent the full interface loading time","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":". "}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5a4251bb"}},{"type":"toggle","attrs":{"title":"Where do these improvements come from?","open":false,"id":"node-57424d02"},"content":[{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Page summary and component catalog metadata are saved as a rebuildable derived cache ("},{"type":"text","text":"local/page-summaries.json","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"text","text":"local/catalog-metadata.json","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"), and recheck the version when the content changes."}],"attrs":{"id":"node-c0af509d"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-2c49330a"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"File notifications preserve project, page, and component identities, and the interface refreshes only the affected parts and incorporates concurrent refreshes."}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1b872572"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-2d49349d"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The directory is loaded on demand, and the target page no longer waits for the global component directory to be opened."}],"attrs":{"id":"node-ca617173"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-2a492fe4"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The parsing and SQLite operations of search, history and reference queries are placed in separate Node worker threads, and only the latest requests for pending queries are retained."}],"attrs":{"id":"node-453978a8"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-2b493177"}},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Component thumbnails are generated on demand, reusing hidden preview windows, and cached by source code and component identity."}],"attrs":{"id":"node-7462ad09"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-28492cbe"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-bb5332a5"}}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-58424e95"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edit and save"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Editing a 1,500-paragraph page in real Electron: the input itself takes about 0.74 seconds. After the recovery draft was changed to compact storage and the save requests of the same generation were merged, the time from the end of input to the completion of official save dropped from about 21 seconds to 1.3 seconds."}],"attrs":{"id":"node-a5756ea7"}},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The editor reuses the coordinated content structure, reducing full-page cloning and repeated serialization; ordinary saves retain unchanged nodes and components. Attribute verification, serial save, version check and save before closing are still valid."}],"attrs":{"id":"node-a4756d14"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-a77571cd"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"whiteboard gesture"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The test artboard has 602 root objects: 600 generated shapes, plus native Page tables and charts made with real Git commit data. The gesture is a total of five groups of dragging 60 px left and right on the same object. The data comes from the cumulative thread count of Chrome DevTools Protocol."}],"attrs":{"id":"node-a675703a"}},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"chart","data":{"title":"The thread consumption of ten drags","description":"Two samples per condition, the second sample being \"hotter\". The lower the number, the better.","type":"bar","labels":["style recalculation","Script execution","total task duration"],"series":[{"name":"Before optimization · Sample 1","values":[1.44,4.22,6.89],"color":"#b9c0cc"},{"name":"Before optimization · Sample 2","values":[1.25,2.38,4.56],"color":"#8d96a6"},{"name":"After optimization · Sample 1","values":[0.38,1.37,2.4],"color":"#6f7be0"},{"name":"After optimization · Sample 2","values":[0.35,1,1.7],"color":"#2e3bc9"}],"unit":"Second"},"id":"node-a175685b"}},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"index"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-8b13a187"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f3918170"}},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before optimization (sample 1 / 2)"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-668a109c"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f4918303"}},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"After optimization (sample 1 / 2)"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-61614e51"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-f5918496"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-caff318f"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"DOM node"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-36cdf2c4"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-181b125b"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"27,939 / 27,917"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-bbf5eb8f"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-171b10c8"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"9,710 / 9,684"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-8cccb72e"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-1a1b1581"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-c9ff2ffc"}},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"JS heap usage"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-5895c9ed"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e8f1ddfa"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"231.3 / 178.5 MB"}],"attrs":{"id":"node-340c3902"}}],"attrs":{"id":"node-e9f1df8d"}},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","te