irectory without modifying the input.","code":"node scripts/performance-benchmark.mjs /absolute/content-library","note":"The input needs to be in Git repository format (including `repository.git `); the current content library in SQLite format cannot be used directly as input.","result":"The result is written under `output/performance/run-*/`."},{"title":"Measurement storage write","body":"Run four scenarios in full. After a scene fails, you can use `--resume `to keep the completed scene and continue.","code":"# 完整运行\nnode scripts/storage-benchmark.mjs\n# 文本场景的修改次数（默认 10,000）\nnode scripts/storage-benchmark.mjs --changes=1000\n# 保留已完成的场景继续\nnode scripts/storage-benchmark.mjs --resume=/absolute/completed-results-directory","result":"The result is written in `output/storage-benchmarks/run-*/results.json `."},{"title":"Review in real window","body":"Neither a cache hit nor a window appearance equals content loading. Interface changes also need to be checked in the browser and desktop, including narrow screen and offline export."}]},"integrity":"sha256-0c4f6546ba7ab683adfaa028a3ad70cea166479204a4f1f462ef27eb314ff07b"},"id":"node-1c6ddb37"}},{"type":"horizontalRule","attrs":{"id":"node-9970de95"}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2,"id":"node-9870dd02"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Next"}]},{"type":"widget","attrs":{"kind":"custom","data":{"componentId":"doc-cards","version":"1.0.0","props":{"columns":3,"cards":[{"icon":"🏗️","title":"Architecture","body":"Which layer are caches, worker threads and storage located at?","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/architecture"},{"icon":"🗂️","title":"Content Library & Versions","body":"Current storage contracts, drafts and conflicts.","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/library"},{"icon":"📤","title":"Export & Share","body":"Size limits and compression for inline fragments.","href":"https://showai.renaissancemind.ai/doc/export"}]},"integrity":"sha256-25e52118b12fe0ba739f259e46f1282ec445ea2fc1829dba6d4312f6